{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14708","headline":"御沟新柳 · 冯宿","name":"御沟新柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夹道天渠远，垂丝御柳新。\n千条宜向日，万户共迎春。\n轻翠含烟发，微音逐吹频。\n静看思渡口，回望忆江滨。\n嫋嫋分游骑，依依驻旅人。\n阳和如可及，攀折在兹辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯宿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}